# Network lab (D8, D121, D122). Pyra's thin branch reaches toward Thorn; Thorn's Marsh Lurker
# (Knotting) sits on it, pausing everything behind it (red leylines). In Thorn's turn, Bond can
# steal the paused hexes that touch Thorn's network — stealing the chokepoint cuts the rest.
# Try also: Collapse Network (the realm lock), Sever the Leyline (a cut), Ash bonding into its
# own pool, a Thorn Wall (a Structure with Knotting).
name Network lab
seed 9
map hexagon 4
start A 0,3
start B 0,-3
home A radius=1
home B radius=1
neutral fill terrain.fire
type Forest 0,0 1,-1 0,1
champion A champion.pyra
champion B champion.thorn
terraindeck A terrain.fire*7
terraindeck B terrain.water*4 terrain.darkness*3
openinghand 0
noshuffle
bond A 0,2 0,1 0,0 1,-1
bond B 0,-2 1,-2
place B creature.marsh-lurker 0,1
place A companion.ash -1,2
handcard A spell.firebolt structure.watchtower
handcard B spell.sever structure.thorn-wall
mana A Fire 3
mana A Metal 2
